meta {
  name: 315. Admin audit log: probe write with sensitive path and query values (404, nothing changes)
  type: http
  seq: 315
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/vpas/torg/{{subRevampTorgId}}/99999999?mobile=9876543210&otp=123456&reason=ENG-690%20redaction%20probe
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{subRevampAdminToken}}
}

docs {
  Deletes a VPA mapping that does not exist (id 99999999 on a torg with none), so nothing changes whatever the answer is. It only exists to give the audit log
  a row whose `vpaId` path value and `mobile` / `otp` query values must be hidden. The result is not asserted; 316 checks the row.
}
